{
  "slug": "memex-bookmarking-2nd-brain",
  "name": "Memex Bookmarking 2nd Brain",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "This is the Claude plugin for Memex.Garden, a bookmarking second brain for humans and agents.\n\nYou can save, transcribe, summarize and search anything you come across. Websites, Notes, Web Highlights, Youtube, X, Tiktok, Instagram, PDFs, Reddit or images.\"\n\nHow it works:\n- You can instruct your agent to save any url and it will be indexed, videos transcribed, images analyzed in a powerful full-text and vector search.\n- You can query for saved content and get back structured data, readymade for your agent to process",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 hook** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `memex-agent-skill` (Search and save Memex library content, follow RSS and YouTube sources, and fetch, process, or drain pending Memex…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `UserPromptSubmit`\n- **MCP servers** (2): `memex`, `memex-realtime`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install memex-bookmarking-2nd-brain@claude-community` from `WorldBrain/memex-claude`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 2
  },
